{"body":{"model":"opus","reads":{"$ref":"01M6S09BX5DDBXFS8D3EQZG0QR"},"seedFrom":"inside","top":{"$ref":"01M6S74NQ5WZX6X2V8MTV5415Q"},"understandings":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NQ5WZX6X2V8MTV5415Q"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NQ6JD0XSM12031HC5VM"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NQ743G5X4S9DE0SXK76"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NQ8Y94N63YSG34TWDTR"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NQ9792C1HYV41ZT50VA"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NQA9BGS6KP1K62DNK7X"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NQBFBCN9MA1FQRV9PSG"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NQCXMSAB9AP6B3SEKZN"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NQDYAT3ZWM4MJ6RPVCV"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NQE015N7W768VR5684R"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NQF6WBSKSDRXCN7K2DY"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NQGC9Y9QWYJD43NNJ07"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NQHH1ASG327BPF4SRA2"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NQJQWNJH3Q11XZFAW7K"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NQKSB25KG56RNWN51KD"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NQM3QSNK8C1FYNA8BJ7"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NQNRJFH5DAJ099DGVZV"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NQPFS3CF16Z6ZVBH58R"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NQQ7NGSHDKGP2GKZZJ4"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NQRKTC6A213HJ1F61JS"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NQS02ZPB2SDXYCSFYP9"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NQTMQEWYXD0YBEHY0S3"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NQV4JJQ9PD6029NEN9X"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NQWHNE4ZJEM223S9AQQ"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NQXSN52CRDFZ7ER0RDD"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NQYX2RKC3001TGP6T3M"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NQZ5C6Z5A21GMAF3RCQ"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NR061KYJ89AH98H327J"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NR1E6GNVKVDDM3RMJNV"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NR2J075H1A6ANV6RD7Y"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NR3AXCDS0F422EBCEFT"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NR47X4X50XRM8QQVTC9"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NR57N738FC38R7NAH5J"}]},"id":"01M6S74NR68QWRH9Y7112B5GHF","instance":["01M6S74NG0JR8Q2S499AF7FR71"],"kind":"version","name":"branch-08","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"where authority over meaning and action sits","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NQ6JD0XSM12031HC5VM"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NQA9BGS6KP1K62DNK7X"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NQM3QSNK8C1FYNA8BJ7"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NQTMQEWYXD0YBEHY0S3"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NQYX2RKC3001TGP6T3M"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NR2J075H1A6ANV6RD7Y"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NR3AXCDS0F422EBCEFT"}],"prose":"The paper keeps circling one problem: how a whole can act together when its parts keep their own insides, their own vocabularies and their own judgement. Every move it makes, from virtues given bodies to meanings agreed at runtime to a rehearsal in simulation, is a way of binding without absorbing.","title":"Coordinating parts one does not own"},"id":"01M6S74NQ5WZX6X2V8MTV5415Q","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"how much a part keeps for itself","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NQ743G5X4S9DE0SXK76"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NQ8Y94N63YSG34TWDTR"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NQ9792C1HYV41ZT50VA"}],"prose":"A holon is set apart from an agent by being nested: it answers upward while keeping a bounded freedom. The lineage runs from a philosopher's idea through factory floors into grids and buildings.","title":"Parts that keep their insides"},"id":"01M6S74NQ6JD0XSM12031HC5VM","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"rank in the nest","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S08ZK9JNT733QPVPKKPB33"},{"$ref":"01M6S08ZQJDTPV1K5MVEQB7EKC"},{"$ref":"01M6S08ZQKAE5DJFP8AQZCYBJW"},{"$ref":"01M6S0932TYVDNG7V3F9FPTYPQ"}],"prose":"Position in the holarchy decides how far a holon may decide; authority is spread across levels yet still thickens toward the top.","title":"Nesting sets the reach of freedom"},"id":"01M6S74NQ743G5X4S9DE0SXK76","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the line that separates the two kinds","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S08ZK9JNT733QPVPKKPB33"},{"$ref":"01M6S08ZQJDTPV1K5MVEQB7EKC"},{"$ref":"01M6S08ZT4PVPYCGQYJV7PR3M5"},{"$ref":"01M6S092GHEZCKHBE4ZKEW3J78"}],"prose":"Agents act flat and free; holons add organisational awareness across levels, and a holonic agent is the hybrid. Humans in the loop and agentic AI blur the line further.","title":"Holon set against agent"},"id":"01M6S74NQ8Y94N63YSG34TWDTR","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"which domain the idea migrates into next","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S08YR2M952H7ZN6R90BBJZ"},{"$ref":"01M6S08YV85BZVM4G694CQKMYX"},{"$ref":"01M6S08ZXGVT2TSASGV9X2TYHX"},{"$ref":"01M6S090806VNZVA97AV0V0XD2"},{"$ref":"01M6S090GX8FSDRJ0E4TJ1H3DX"},{"$ref":"01M6S090KZCM15DWJFKQVKT5TM"},{"$ref":"01M6S090PDBF0YZFN6YMV9WJ5W"}],"prose":"From Koestler to holonic manufacturing to smart grids, construction and data pipelines, the idea spreads wherever control must be decentralised.","title":"A lineage that keeps widening"},"id":"01M6S74NQ9792C1HYV41ZT50VA","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"which concern earns its own holon","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NQBFBCN9MA1FQRV9PSG"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NQCXMSAB9AP6B3SEKZN"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NQF6WBSKSDRXCN7K2DY"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NQGC9Y9QWYJD43NNJ07"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NQHH1ASG327BPF4SRA2"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NQJQWNJH3Q11XZFAW7K"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NQKSB25KG56RNWN51KD"}],"prose":"Concerns that autonomous systems handle badly are each handed to a specialised kind of holon, so that ethics, horizon, meaning, fairness and watchfulness become roles rather than properties of one mind.","title":"Virtues given separate bodies"},"id":"01M6S74NQA9BGS6KP1K62DNK7X","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the shortfall being answered","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S08Z79ESR6PT11B13KVPB3"},{"$ref":"01M6S0912JT6RA5BZ9DA4QWXW0"},{"$ref":"01M6S0916BHS51YPSAGK594MMT"},{"$ref":"01M6S091HFR7QY67Y0XKA5J0DF"},{"$ref":"01M6S091KTFAT80JBWTQHERM05"},{"$ref":"01M6S0932TYVDNG7V3F9FPTYPQ"}],"prose":"Brittle adaptation, embedded bias, missing accountability and thin awareness are named first; the roles are cut to fit them.","title":"The gaps the roles answer"},"id":"01M6S74NQBFBCN9MA1FQRV9PSG","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"what a decision is tested against","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NQDYAT3ZWM4MJ6RPVCV"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NQE015N7W768VR5684R"}],"prose":"Two roles stand beside a decision rather than making it: one tests it against norms, the other against known distortions.","title":"Checks laid on a decision"},"id":"01M6S74NQCXMSAB9AP6B3SEKZN","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the encoded norm","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S093679WVYX9W76WMQSFYF"},{"$ref":"01M6S093AKQX05TGPX6C9SX1YG"},{"$ref":"01M6S093C3FHWQ6C5YRWRHZ9BN"},{"$ref":"01M6S093D1G6HQ1AF4PPZ6Z3M4"},{"$ref":"01M6S093DCQMTYP12QJRK0KEX9"},{"$ref":"01M6S093FSPTEATFTYCNEJEMQ4"}],"prose":"Ethics is written into ontologies and rule systems and weighed alongside operational goals, with the hard part being which norms and at what cost to speed.","title":"Norms encoded as constraints"},"id":"01M6S74NQDYAT3ZWM4MJ6RPVCV","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"detectability of a bias","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S0949YC2RGE7SVC8VQ2BJA"},{"$ref":"01M6S094DC83NRPYHDHCDK6Z0T"},{"$ref":"01M6S094EZEHMWPGCTN09CMTBK"},{"$ref":"01M6S094G14MVA149MAHGZ3JBG"},{"$ref":"01M6S094GAF5Q516BRBZPKAK33"},{"$ref":"01M6S094H6M3N8CRFWQ98BWV6P"},{"$ref":"01M6S094K282XW4C3DANB6FYG7"}],"prose":"Bias is treated as patterns that can be catalogued and audited in a loop, borrowing from fault detection.","title":"Distortion caught and corrected"},"id":"01M6S74NQE015N7W768VR5684R","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"time horizon of the objective","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S093JWWSFCKGZGR3EF21M7"},{"$ref":"01M6S093NFQRR88X9PD990GSFB"},{"$ref":"01M6S093PESAZNQ254MP8QMHMG"},{"$ref":"01M6S093RVB5VEFTQ40R9WFVFX"},{"$ref":"01M6S093W4DZ6B9GKDGMNA5DED"}],"prose":"Effective holons weigh consequences beyond the goal at hand, which forces a question of how effect is ever measured.","title":"The long horizon against the quick win"},"id":"01M6S74NQF6WBSKSDRXCN7K2DY","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the structure that makes data interpretable","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S08Z79ESR6PT11B13KVPB3"},{"$ref":"01M6S093YQ6AXJZ5BM1HF4WFQX"},{"$ref":"01M6S0941499S7BC44BDW6VFZ3"},{"$ref":"01M6S0943RC500MSJR3TQ6FQP3"},{"$ref":"01M6S0944TNASX9K8JK5V5RTRP"},{"$ref":"01M6S09453A04JFE48Z6412NSP"},{"$ref":"01M6S09474K3F10PRDVM1JZJ06"}],"prose":"Understanding holons turn mixed data into situational knowledge through ontologies and inference, at the cost of building and keeping those ontologies.","title":"Meaning built from structure"},"id":"01M6S74NQGC9Y9QWYJD43NNJ07","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"alignment between local and global","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S094NQQR6J9EGV6K49FTZS"},{"$ref":"01M6S094QH86CGJ2VPFEPRMBRA"},{"$ref":"01M6S094RFB8ZYRDV9DDW98ERX"},{"$ref":"01M6S094SYAEG8KEJ8AW61YRGQ"},{"$ref":"01M6S094VHECP7DNYBAFKGW3ZP"},{"$ref":"01M6S094VT6R1N5QB4CV4JQNWP"},{"$ref":"01M6S094XMKX1YC7SH2K1A4ZDZ"},{"$ref":"01M6S0978GWDT0ZWN8XT22K2EJ"}],"prose":"Vigilant holons share awareness so that locally sound choices do not drift out of line with the whole; they become the orchestrators.","title":"Watching across levels"},"id":"01M6S74NQHH1ASG327BPF4SRA2","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the direction of flow among roles","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S094Z5HFC2AJXX9P288K6H"},{"$ref":"01M6S094Z96KNZDEW5TXAHT8KF"},{"$ref":"01M6S0950DPJQCE6FKYH7TSD58"},{"$ref":"01M6S0951AZ5JE4ABRCQSXWQ2F"},{"$ref":"01M6S0953BG3WSGDTSRPS30552"},{"$ref":"01M6S0953C5H9DMB8CRTPS6YK3"}],"prose":"Checks flow into the effective holon, understanding feeds both, and vigilance spans all layers; the roles form a small holarchy of their own.","title":"How the roles feed one another"},"id":"01M6S74NQJQWNJH3Q11XZFAW7K","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the recurring scene","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S08ZXGVT2TSASGV9X2TYHX"},{"$ref":"01M6S0943RC500MSJR3TQ6FQP3"},{"$ref":"01M6S0944TNASX9K8JK5V5RTRP"},{"$ref":"01M6S094SYAEG8KEJ8AW61YRGQ"},{"$ref":"01M6S094VHECP7DNYBAFKGW3ZP"},{"$ref":"01M6S09680J8SGQ5QP5F1RE969"},{"$ref":"01M6S097ZEDYHSVRT1CRE7YFZ3"},{"$ref":"01M6S0981VVD99XQ72EV84VJE6"}],"prose":"Hospitals, disasters, cities and roads recur under nearly every role, so the examples act as shared ground the roles are tried on.","title":"Scenes that travel between roles"},"id":"01M6S74NQKSB25KG56RNWN51KD","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"when agreement about meaning is struck","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NQNRJFH5DAJ099DGVZV"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NQPFS3CF16Z6ZVBH58R"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NQQ7NGSHDKGP2GKZZJ4"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NQRKTC6A213HJ1F61JS"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NQS02ZPB2SDXYCSFYP9"}],"prose":"Rather than forcing one model on all, agreement is negotiated between parties when they meet, and a dedicated holon is built to broker it.","title":"Meaning agreed at the meeting point"},"id":"01M6S74NQM3QSNK8C1FYNA8BJ7","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"how much each party must give up","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S0957APBWA2W6N7RK4HA1J"},{"$ref":"01M6S095E1M1ENNRVMHW352873"},{"$ref":"01M6S095GRG93K5EG2K71B1CKV"},{"$ref":"01M6S095KGFWMBWNW19K2CKDZC"},{"$ref":"01M6S095NRWBNYWJEQPXGFXTC5"},{"$ref":"01M6S095PBA4ZRBXY1GY14VWHR"},{"$ref":"01M6S095Q6V5YHG5EJ40PT2KHP"},{"$ref":"01M6S095RQV1YWJ0PTP40VJPNM"},{"$ref":"01M6S095WN23Y8DRJGK8C24NJV"},{"$ref":"01M6S096NJ1YCGW3GT69CTCK3B"},{"$ref":"01M6S096SSRKHN58F6YBT2PD3S"}],"prose":"One can impose a format, share a meta-model, or translate case by case; only the last leaves each party whole.","title":"Three ways to agree"},"id":"01M6S74NQNRJFH5DAJ099DGVZV","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the lifespan of a shared meaning","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S09654M23DFDXTHS52MBXA"},{"$ref":"01M6S097JQCMENMDG4DXR4V4ZJ"},{"$ref":"01M6S0992KZHB02ZBDX260T244"}],"prose":"Short-lived ontologies are temporary semantic contracts struck for one exchange and discarded after, so coherence never needs a permanent repository.","title":"Ontologies made to be thrown away"},"id":"01M6S74NQPFS3CF16Z6ZVBH58R","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"which organ does the binding","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S09710AV583QD1MPBPW32H"},{"$ref":"01M6S097N1AM8EGG88P63ZS8D9"},{"$ref":"01M6S097S811FX4ENN201BA6PM"},{"$ref":"01M6S097VCBK9XZ25KFJF0ND5N"},{"$ref":"01M6S0982Y69VFJ6C8NQBP89NE"},{"$ref":"01M6S0988S3MZFMVE7H1RCZSJZ"},{"$ref":"01M6S098BNS851MZHX3SFT2NYC"},{"$ref":"01M6S098ECD82QGT0KGXZG1EAS"},{"$ref":"01M6S098FH9YH6FMBTFF272DJA"},{"$ref":"01M6S098GRA69D8E61BGJ3ETJF"},{"$ref":"01M6S098HDWNMXMGHDKP7HYH0G"},{"$ref":"01M6S098M0RG9CGW3VBAQ8E35X"}],"prose":"The federated interoperability holon is given organs: an orchestrator, a graph of what can connect to what, a translator, a finder, and a workflow maker and runner, with language models proposed for the thinking parts.","title":"The broker as a body"},"id":"01M6S74NQQ7NGSHDKGP2GKZZJ4","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"which role sits inside the mediator","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S09710AV583QD1MPBPW32H"},{"$ref":"01M6S0974ESZ3BC4PQGRAQ140D"},{"$ref":"01M6S0976Z3XG1JS1A2VTTTBZN"},{"$ref":"01M6S0978GWDT0ZWN8XT22K2EJ"},{"$ref":"01M6S097S811FX4ENN201BA6PM"},{"$ref":"01M6S097ZEDYHSVRT1CRE7YFZ3"},{"$ref":"01M6S0981VVD99XQ72EV84VJE6"}],"prose":"Inside the broker the five roles reappear as its subholons: fairness for retrieval, ethics as a validation layer, vigilance as orchestration.","title":"The broker absorbs the virtues"},"id":"01M6S74NQRKTC6A213HJ1F61JS","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"whether mediating becomes ruling","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S08YN14HRJCEVFSBB1SNPM"},{"$ref":"01M6S096SSRKHN58F6YBT2PD3S"},{"$ref":"01M6S0988S3MZFMVE7H1RCZSJZ"},{"$ref":"01M6S0997JNB7G6FJ23GTB226M"},{"$ref":"01M6S099B342ME391EQMJR2ENW"},{"$ref":"01M6S09A5WEFJY26M01RF4RE1F"},{"$ref":"01M6S09AG184GYEQ79ZCXADC7B"}],"prose":"The broker is said to work without central control yet is also named the highest authority; coordination and command lean against each other.","title":"A mediator that sits on top"},"id":"01M6S74NQS02ZPB2SDXYCSFYP9","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"who steers the run","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NQV4JJQ9PD6029NEN9X"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NQWHNE4ZJEM223S9AQQ"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NQXSN52CRDFZ7ER0RDD"}],"prose":"Simulation is not only a model of the holons but something they steer; the system builds a mirror of itself in which it can be tried and corrected.","title":"The whole rehearses itself"},"id":"01M6S74NQTMQEWYXD0YBEHY0S3","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"what is carried over from agents","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S091PP1ZZQG6WZ7R3BMA7Q"},{"$ref":"01M6S091YM28K8SWNXGQD94QWR"},{"$ref":"01M6S092GHEZCKHBE4ZKEW3J78"},{"$ref":"01M6S092KE6ZMECGQSSQBF90BV"},{"$ref":"01M6S09BPKS0KGT7SR4GE75ACB"}],"prose":"Holon-directed simulation is derived by analogy from agent-directed simulation and its line of emergent social models.","title":"A taxonomy inherited from agents"},"id":"01M6S74NQV4JJQ9PD6029NEN9X","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"how far a holon may alter the run","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S092MRCB5DHW2QJWZCMH6P"},{"$ref":"01M6S092NT1X7H7BGXEJM161WB"},{"$ref":"01M6S092PS96FXNTYW0G07YCMZ"},{"$ref":"01M6S092QP2J2DR6DJZ6E197EW"},{"$ref":"01M6S092RHVP4CPW8DAZR8Q3QP"},{"$ref":"01M6S092RXW7KF4BQKGGRPEJTG"},{"$ref":"01M6S092VYEKZR8236TWY9GTNW"},{"$ref":"01M6S092WW0PH5GJ4A54XXD3EV"},{"$ref":"01M6S092XTJ4DM3B12H6CFN807"}],"prose":"Holons range from passive sources of data to proactive authors of the simulation's rules.","title":"Degrees of steering"},"id":"01M6S74NQWHNE4ZJEM223S9AQQ","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"fidelity between the system and its double","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S099RX7Z7ZGC575Z0RX8W5"},{"$ref":"01M6S09AH0YMYNDBY3FA44T68F"},{"$ref":"01M6S09AH1PWXPQSYN6X82S0CZ"},{"$ref":"01M6S09AXT9RAEXAGQP942K710"},{"$ref":"01M6S09B0KJPXKB931FZC1JHE3"},{"$ref":"01M6S09B4PEE2MM0G40XAMDENJ"}],"prose":"Each holon gets a federate double under a manager that is itself a subholon of the broker; errors flag upward and invalidate results.","title":"A federate twin of the system"},"id":"01M6S74NQXSN52CRDFZ7ER0RDD","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"where nothing arrives","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NQZ5C6Z5A21GMAF3RCQ"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NR061KYJ89AH98H327J"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NR1E6GNVKVDDM3RMJNV"}],"prose":"The sparse countryside becomes the place to try the whole; its most distinctive aim is finding where no transport reaches at all.","title":"Locating absence on the ground"},"id":"01M6S74NQYX2RKC3001TGP6T3M","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
